# The tool-neutral tree. Every agent that follows the AGENTS.md convention reads
# this root, so it names no harness's tools: roles stand in for names — your
# question tool, a read-only sub-agent — and the invocation carries no prefix,
# because each harness spells that its own way and the agent knows its own.
